{"ref":"BDB, עֹרֵב","hw":"עֹרֵב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֹרֵב</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.15\">Lv 11:15</a></sup> <strong>raven</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.11\">Is 34:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הָע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:7\" href=\"/Genesis.8.7\">Gn 8:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.15\">Lv 11:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.14\">Dt 14:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 38:41\" href=\"/Job.38.41\">Jb 38:41</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּעוֹרֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:11\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.11\">Ct 5:11</a> black <em>as the raven;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי עֹרֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:9\" href=\"/Psalms.147.9\">ψ 147:9</a>, <em>young ravens;</em> pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעֹרְבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.4\">1 K 17:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.6\">6</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹרְבֵי־נַחַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.17\">Pr 30:17</a>.","next":"BDB, עֲרָבָה²","prev":"BDB, ערב⁴"}